This distribution contains the vap-log, vap-core, vap-decode-api,
vap-decode-jvm, vap-vk-android, vap-decode-android and vap-compose release
module closure copied from the local Hanna repository's library-teyes/vap
working tree, including the frozen Region implementation for 1.0.0-alpha01.
Production Kotlin/C++/shader source bytes and tests are retained exactly.
Standalone release settings, publishing metadata, the reduced dependency
catalog and license-resource packaging are Prism-specific release glue.
PROVENANCE.json in the parent snapshot directory records the source commit,
local modifications, per-file hashes and the precise redistribution boundary.

Auditable source distribution:
https://github.com/kaus-io/prism-motion/tree/main/thirdparty/prism-sdk/vap

The original MIT license is retained in LICENSE and redistributed in artifacts
as META-INF/prism-sdk/vap/{module}/LICENSE, together with this NOTICE.
Each module uses its own path so applications can merge all SDK artifacts.
The unused vap_seq.frag.spv binary is excluded; the original GLSL and embedded
SPIR-V C headers are retained. No precompiled JNI libraries are included.
External Maven dependencies retain their separate upstream licensing terms.
